Manage Confluent Cloud usm kafka clusters.

Usage:
  confluent usm kafka-cluster [command]

Aliases:
  kafka-cluster, kafka

Available Commands:
  deregister  Delete one or more usm kafka clusters.
  describe    Describe a usm kafka cluster.
  list        List usm kafka clusters.
  register    Create a usm kafka cluster.

Global Flags:
  -h, --help            Show help for this command.
      --unsafe-trace    Equivalent to -vvvv, but also log HTTP requests and responses which might contain plaintext secrets.
  -v, --verbose count   Increase verbosity (-v for warn, -vv for info, -vvv for debug, -vvvv for trace).

Use "confluent usm kafka-cluster [command] --help" for more information about a command.
